{"title":"2025 CJMC Problems/Problem A1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(slow)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (slow)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(faster)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (faster)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the units (ones) digit of the product:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccf406f2e473525b20b734699c6e0d949576327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 3 \\times 5 \\times 7 \\times 9 \\times 11 \\times 13 \\times 15 \\times 17 \\times 19 \\times 21 \\times 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"419\" height=\"15\" /></center>\n<p>(A) 3\n(B) 5\n(C) 7\n(D) 8\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28slow.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(slow)\">Solution 1 (slow)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (slow)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying the product out, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/5/26550ab7db68c52f603fbc31a076ca6f4b11d889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$316~234~143~225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />. The units digit of this number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005df1d9535f57fd6767209c235ffc4450acfd30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(faster)\">Solution 2 (faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise that the product is odd because all of the numbers involved in the product are odd. \n</p><p>Next, the product must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is included as one of the numbers in the product. This means that the units digit must either be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, if the units digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the product would be even. This leads to a contradiction because the product was supposed to be odd. Thus, the units digit must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005df1d9535f57fd6767209c235ffc4450acfd30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is included as one of the numbers in the product and all of the numbers in the product are integers. This means that the units digit must either be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Of these values, the only one that is an answer choice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005df1d9535f57fd6767209c235ffc4450acfd30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CJMC_Problems/Problem_A2\" title=\"2025 CJMC Problems/Problem A2\">Problem A2</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195440\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 84/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2588/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:38022:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195440 and revision id 293511. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}